# sym_inc_test.am1 and sym_inc_part.ah: the line each global label is defined
# on, in the file it is WRITTEN in.  Read off the numbering of those two
# sources and written before the first run; check 2 derives the same with awk.
#
# name          line    file
afterinc        8       # sym_inc_test.am1, after the include returns
beforeinc       6       # sym_inc_test.am1, before the include
incfirst        9       # sym_inc_part.ah
incfwd          11      # sym_inc_part.ah, referenced before it is defined
inclast         12      # sym_inc_part.ah
